=== INVESTIGATION ===

Web source: web/src/features/system/pages/DataExportPage.tsx (1268 lines)
Route: /data-export

The web page lets a user export vehicle data. Sections (top → bottom):
  1. StatsRow              — 4 MetricCards: Total Exports / Total Size / Most Exported (By Count) / Last Export
  2. AccountExportPanel    — GDPR "Download my data" (useCreateAccountExport → POST /export/jobs/account)
  3. ExportWizard          — "New Export": type grid, format, optional column picker
                             (useExportColumns → GET /exports/columns?type=), vehicle, date range, submit
  4. FormatInfoCards       — CSV preview + JSON preview cards
  5. DataOverviewCard      — drives / charging-sessions record counts
  6. ExportHistoryTable    — jobs table (loading / empty / error / populated) + active badge + refresh
  7. ScheduledExportsPanel — recurring exports (wrapped in <RequiresAuth>)

Data sources (manifest):
  - useCreateAccountExport → POST /export/jobs/account
  - useExportColumns       → GET  /exports/columns [type]
  (the page additionally reads useExportJobs GET /export/jobs, useVehicles GET /vehicles,
   and the submit mutation POST /export/jobs — all bound through the model seam)

Panel→parity mapping (12 manifest panels):
  GlassPanel1  = AccountExportPanel (Download my data)
  GlassPanel2  = ExportWizard (New Export)
  GlassPanel3  = FormatInfoCards CSV preview
  GlassPanel4  = FormatInfoCards JSON preview
  Total-Exports / Total-Size / Most-Exported / Last-Export = the 4 StatsRow metric cards
  GlassPanel9  = DataOverviewCard
  GlassPanel10 = ExportHistoryTable
  GlassPanel11 = ExportTypeSelector (the data-type card grid inside the wizard)
  GlassPanel12 = ScheduledExportsPanel

Apple target dir: apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/System/ — follows the co-located
neighbour style (DataRepairPage/HelpPage/RoadmapPage/ScheduledExportsPanel): SwiftUI
+ @Observable model + injected data-source seam, native materials (ADR-005),
ContentUnavailableView / .redacted skeletons, String(localized:) with the web key
names. A sibling `ScheduledExportsPanel` already exists in this dir and is reused.

Toolchain: Xcode 26.5, swiftlint 0.63.3, xcodegen present, pwsh present.
KMP Shared.xcframework is ABSENT (requires the Kotlin/Native + Gradle toolchain,
staged only on macos-latest CI per apps/macos-pending-verifications.md). The full
`xcodebuild build test` is therefore deferred to CI exactly as for every sibling
P4-apple page; host-runnable build proxy is `swiftc -typecheck` against the real
