=== IMPLEMENTATION ===

Created (12 files, all < 400 lines for the swiftlint file_length rule):
  DataExportModels.swift           — DataExportType/Format/JobStatus/Tone enums, wire structs, payloads
  DataExportFormatters.swift       — DataExportDisplay: formatBytes/fmtInt/formatRelative/
                                     formatDurationMsLong/dateTime/daysAgo (ported from web lib)
  DataExportDataSource.swift       — DataExportDataSource protocol (loadJobs/loadVehicles/
                                     useExportColumns/submitExport/useCreateAccountExport) + Sample seed
  DataExportPageModel.swift        — @MainActor @Observable model: state machine + intents + derived stats
  DataExportStyle.swift            — dataExportPanel() material modifier, DataExportChip, DataExportMetricCard
  DataExportWizardComponents.swift — DataExportTypeSelector (GlassPanel11), FormatSelector, PresetSelector
  DataExportColumnPicker.swift     — web ColumnPickerSection selection semantics (required/select-all/clear)
  DataExportWizardView.swift       — the 4-step New Export wizard (GlassPanel2)
  DataExportPageViews.swift        — AccountPanel(GP1), FormatCards(GP3/GP4), OverviewCard(GP9)
  DataExportHistoryView.swift      — ExportHistory(GP10): loading/empty/error/success + adaptive job rows
  DataExportPage.swift             — page scaffold: header, statsRow, sections, feedback alert
  DataExportPreviewSources.swift   — DEBUG empty/failing data sources for previews

Updated:
  apps/apple/Localization/Localizable.xcstrings — added 93 keys (4 of the 59 required
    already existed: Duration/Status/Time/Vehicle); UTF-8 verified (½, em-dash intact)
  apps/parity/apple-ledger.json — added page:system/DataExport rows (apple-macos + apple-ios)

Design notes:
  - @Observable DataExportPageModel drives every region; no networking in the views (ADR-004).
  - 4 data states surfaced via DataExportState (loading/empty/error/success); the panels render
    and switch state in place rather than gating the surface (web-faithful).
  - Adaptive macOS + iOS via ViewThatFits / LazyVGrid(.adaptive) — one view layer (ADR-002/006).
  - Materials (.regularMaterial / .quaternary) instead of hand-rolled glass (ADR-005).
  - HIG-native: ContentUnavailableView (empty/error), .redacted(.placeholder) skeletons,
    RelativeDateTimeFormatter for "Last Export", segmented Picker for format, DatePicker for ranges.
  - Control-plane values only (bytes/counts/timestamps) → no SI conversion applies (ADR-005).
  - a11y: labels/values/traits on every panel, chip, card and job row; Dynamic Type via system fonts.
  - i18n: every visible string via String(localized:) with the web key names (ADR-014).

